EXETYPE WINDOWS 3.0
STUB 'WINSTUB.EXE'
CODE MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA PRELOAD MOVEABLE MULTIPLE
HEAPSIZE 4096
STACKSIZE 8192
SEGMENTS
